OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow      
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with  
OL,6,Frain in the west this evening with     
OL,7,Fstrong winds towards the coast and     
OL,8,Fover hills, gale force at times.       
OL,9,FElsewhere, remaining dry with clear    
OL,10,Fspells developing in the east allowing 
OL,11,Ftemperatures to drop below freezing,   
OL,12,Fturning frosty.                        
OL,14,CTuesday:FA chilly start for most,      
OL,15,Ffrosty further north and east. Rain in 
OL,16,Fthe west, spreading across Scotland    
OL,17,Fturning to hill snow, with strong      
OL,18,Fcoastal winds, while sunshine favours  
OL,19,FEast Anglia.                           
